# Announcement drafts and their screenshots, kept locally.
announcement/

# Built installers, each version in a folder of its own (release/README.md). The APKs, the
# command-line edition (its sgbus file and .deb, cli/build.mjs) and the README on publishing
# them are committed. The desktop installers (around 100 MB each, past GitHub's file limit)
# only go on the GitHub release; anything else isn't kept either.
release/**
!release/*/
!release/README.md
!release/*/*.apk
!release/*/sgbus
!release/*/sg-bus-timings-cli-*.deb


# Agent worktrees (help desk and workspace boards).
.claude/worktrees/
